omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XUxpp-zz_9UQ7kNvwG5rHXf&_nc_oc=Adr4pW-aNBmEzdxlMtl06dxaFQ4eW0bwTKv2a9jpLe1Eyi96GrKQtzmooKInseBtI14&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0pyH-c6Do87k-VnB_vBTkl_tpm9MWYukvkBCNGcYt44Q&oe=69D63A74"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0VTIioXMvGoQ7kNvwFiKPEa&_nc_oc=AdrHHwRKdMFuq1rdnmsQwe2Y2i3yFBRSNXD8Z2tRgy4u74zxwdGXK6uY48-HPxN_eoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2YWZCaKOv1PjmZNnS2YKW8plP_8ELrF0XN2nD1j1bNRw&oe=69D63BD6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qIF2WGowIroQ7kNvwEoggQz&_nc_oc=AdpkIUvGUT45hYdyQdnhqnE1wZDgTmLO59App8TD6sxN9QCZc2zXOVWxGJ7yDiR_f24&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1sjTNmgBK_ji2KeYu1ge7D4folWg0XZk-Xwz93c_xrfw&oe=69D650F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://